{"page":29,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"1.3 • 네트워크 코어","words":[{"text":"1.3","x":1158,"y":149,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":1233,"y":154,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"네트워크","x":1280,"y":147,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"코어","x":1394,"y":147,"width":53,"height":30}]},{"text":"가 원하는 무엇인가가 포함될 수 있다. 에시지는 제어 기원에: 그림 1.2의 악수하는","words":[{"text":"가","x":152,"y":282,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"원하는","x":201,"y":281,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"무엇인가가","x":319,"y":279,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"포함될","x":506,"y":280,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":623,"y":280,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":677,"y":279,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"에시지는","x":771,"y":279,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"제어","x":924,"y":279,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"기원에:","x":1011,"y":277,"width":122,"height":39},{"text":"그림","x":1154,"y":276,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"1.2의","x":1241,"y":278,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"악수하는","x":1336,"y":277,"width":134,"height":39}]},{"text":"예에서 “안녕” 메시지) 혹은 전자메일 에시지, JPEG 이미지 흐*은 MP3 오디오 파일과","words":[{"text":"예에서","x":152,"y":341,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"“안녕”","x":266,"y":340,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"메시지)","x":376,"y":341,"width":113,"height":37},{"text":"혹은","x":504,"y":340,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"전자메일","x":589,"y":339,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"에시지,","x":738,"y":338,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"JPEG","x":861,"y":343,"width":92,"height":30},{"text":"이미지","x":968,"y":337,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"흐*은","x":1085,"y":337,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"MP3","x":1167,"y":342,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"오디오","x":1257,"y":339,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"파일과","x":1371,"y":338,"width":101,"height":39}]},{"text":"같은 데이터를 포함한다. 송신 종단 시스템에서 목적지 종단 시스템으로 메시지를 보","words":[{"text":"같은","x":152,"y":402,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":235,"y":401,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"포함한다.","x":384,"y":400,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"송신","x":545,"y":400,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"종단","x":629,"y":399,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"시스템에서","x":714,"y":398,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"목적지","x":898,"y":399,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"종단","x":1018,"y":398,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"시스템으로","x":1104,"y":398,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"메시지를","x":1292,"y":400,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"보","x":1439,"y":403,"width":33,"height":30}]},{"text":"내기 위해, 송신 시스템은 긴 메시지를 매것수acket)이라고 하는 작은 데이터 덩어리","words":[{"text":"내기","x":152,"y":461,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"위해,","x":235,"y":462,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":326,"y":460,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"시스템은","x":410,"y":460,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"긴","x":563,"y":461,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"메시지를","x":611,"y":460,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"매것수acket)이라고","x":763,"y":459,"width":310,"height":42},{"text":"하는","x":1090,"y":459,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"작은","x":1174,"y":459,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"데이터","x":1259,"y":459,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"덩어리","x":1375,"y":461,"width":94,"height":38}]},{"text":"로 분할한다. 송신 측과 수신 측 사이에서 각 패킷은 통신 링크와 패킷 스위치(라우터","words":[{"text":"로","x":150,"y":525,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"분할한다.","x":198,"y":521,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":359,"y":521,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"측과","x":441,"y":520,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":523,"y":520,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"측","x":607,"y":521,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"사이에서","x":655,"y":520,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":808,"y":520,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"패킷은","x":856,"y":520,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"통신","x":973,"y":521,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"링크와","x":1061,"y":520,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"패킷","x":1177,"y":520,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"스위치(라우터","x":1259,"y":521,"width":210,"height":39}]},{"text":"와 링크 계층 스위치의 두 가지 유형이 있음)를 거치게 된다. 패킷은 링크의 최대 전송","words":[{"text":"와","x":150,"y":582,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":200,"y":582,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":280,"y":582,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"스위치의","x":361,"y":581,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":512,"y":583,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"가지","x":561,"y":581,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"유형이","x":641,"y":581,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"있음)를","x":760,"y":581,"width":113,"height":39},{"text":"거치게","x":889,"y":581,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"된다.","x":1007,"y":581,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"패킷은","x":1100,"y":581,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"링크의","x":1220,"y":581,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"최대","x":1334,"y":584,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"전송","x":1410,"y":582,"width":65,"height":38}]},{"text":"속도와 같은 속도로 각각의 통신 링크상에서 전송된다. 따라서 송신 종단 시스템 혹은","words":[{"text":"속도와","x":150,"y":643,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"같은","x":267,"y":643,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"속도로","x":348,"y":642,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"각각의","x":466,"y":641,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"통신","x":581,"y":641,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"링크상에서","x":666,"y":642,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"전송된다.","x":850,"y":641,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"따라서","x":1012,"y":641,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"송신","x":1129,"y":641,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"종단","x":1213,"y":642,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"시스템","x":1297,"y":642,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"혹은","x":1409,"y":643,"width":68,"height":37}]},{"text":"패킷 스위치가 R bits/sec의 속도로 링그상에서 L bits의 패킷을 송신한다면, 그 패것을","words":[{"text":"패킷","x":152,"y":704,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"스위치가","x":231,"y":704,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"R","x":380,"y":708,"width":24,"height":28},{"text":"bits/sec의","x":416,"y":702,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"속도로","x":581,"y":702,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"링그상에서","x":699,"y":702,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"L","x":877,"y":706,"width":22,"height":29},{"text":"bits의","x":913,"y":703,"width":89,"height":38},{"text":"패킷을","x":1020,"y":702,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"송신한다면,","x":1136,"y":702,"width":181,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1332,"y":708,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"패것을","x":1379,"y":703,"width":99,"height":37}]},{"text":"전송하는 데 걸리는 시간은 L/R 초이다.","words":[{"text":"전송하는","x":153,"y":765,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"데","x":301,"y":765,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"걸리는","x":348,"y":764,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"시간은","x":462,"y":764,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"L/R","x":575,"y":768,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"초이다.","x":646,"y":764,"width":109,"height":38}]},{"text":"저장-후-전달","words":[{"text":"저장-후-전달","x":153,"y":869,"width":229,"height":44}]},{"text":"대부분의 패킷 스위치는 저장-후-전달 전송(store-and-forward transmission) 방식","words":[{"text":"대부분의","x":154,"y":943,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"패킷","x":302,"y":943,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"스위치는","x":381,"y":943,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"저장-후-전달","x":531,"y":943,"width":227,"height":38},{"text":"전송(store-and-forward","x":771,"y":943,"width":394,"height":39},{"text":"transmission)","x":1177,"y":946,"width":224,"height":34},{"text":"방식","x":1414,"y":941,"width":63,"height":39}]},{"text":"을 이용한다. 저장-후-전달은 스위치가 출력 링크로 패킷의 첫 비트를 전송하기 전에","words":[{"text":"을","x":152,"y":1005,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"이용한다.","x":201,"y":1004,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"저장-후-전달은","x":360,"y":1004,"width":259,"height":38},{"text":"스위치가","x":632,"y":1005,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":783,"y":1005,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"링크로","x":867,"y":1004,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"패킷의","x":985,"y":1004,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"첫","x":1104,"y":1004,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"비트를","x":1152,"y":1004,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"전송하기","x":1270,"y":1004,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"전에","x":1417,"y":1003,"width":62,"height":38}]},{"text":"전체 패킷을 받아야 함을 의미한다. 저장-후-전달 전송을 좀 더 자세히 알아보기 위","words":[{"text":"전체","x":155,"y":1065,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"패킷을","x":236,"y":1065,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"받아야","x":354,"y":1065,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"함을","x":470,"y":1065,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"의미한다.","x":555,"y":1066,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"저장-후-전달","x":719,"y":1065,"width":227,"height":38},{"text":"전송을","x":963,"y":1065,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"좀","x":1082,"y":1067,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":1134,"y":1065,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"자세히","x":1183,"y":1065,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"알아보기","x":1302,"y":1065,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"위","x":1451,"y":1065,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"해, 그림 1.11과 같이 하나의 라우터로 연결되고 2개의 종단 시스템으로 구성된 간단","words":[{"text":"해,","x":154,"y":1127,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":212,"y":1126,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"1.11과","x":297,"y":1126,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"같이","x":412,"y":1126,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":495,"y":1126,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"라우터로","x":615,"y":1127,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"연결되고","x":769,"y":1126,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"2개의","x":921,"y":1126,"width":87,"height":38},{"text":"종단","x":1027,"y":1126,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"시스템으로","x":1114,"y":1126,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"구성된","x":1301,"y":1126,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"간단","x":1417,"y":1126,"width":67,"height":36}]},{"text":"한 네트워크를 고려해 보자. 라우터는 보통 여러 개의 링크를 갖는데 그 이유는 라우터","words":[{"text":"한","x":153,"y":1189,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"네트워크를","x":201,"y":1187,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"고려해","x":383,"y":1188,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"보자.","x":498,"y":1188,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"라우터는","x":590,"y":1188,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"보통","x":739,"y":1188,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":822,"y":1187,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"개의","x":905,"y":1187,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"링크를","x":990,"y":1187,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"갖는데","x":1105,"y":1186,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1222,"y":1192,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"이유는","x":1270,"y":1187,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"라우터","x":1384,"y":1187,"width":95,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 기능이 입력되는 패킷을 출력 링크로 교환하는 것이기 때문이다. 이 간단한 예에서","words":[{"text":"의","x":155,"y":1250,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"기능이","x":203,"y":1248,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"입력되는","x":318,"y":1248,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"패킷을","x":468,"y":1249,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":583,"y":1249,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"링크로","x":669,"y":1249,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"교환하는","x":784,"y":1248,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"것이기","x":939,"y":1248,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"때문이다.","x":1058,"y":1247,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1221,"y":1247,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"간단한","x":1269,"y":1248,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"예에서","x":1384,"y":1248,"width":95,"height":38}]},{"text":"라우터는 한(입력) 링크에서 유일한 다른 접속 링크로 패킷을 전달하는 매우 간단한","words":[{"text":"라우터는","x":156,"y":1310,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"한(입력)","x":306,"y":1310,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"링크에서","x":454,"y":1310,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"유일한","x":606,"y":1309,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":727,"y":1309,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"접속","x":814,"y":1309,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"링크로","x":902,"y":1310,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1024,"y":1309,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"전달하는","x":1147,"y":1309,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"매우","x":1300,"y":1309,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"간단한","x":1383,"y":1309,"width":102,"height":37}]},{"text":"기능을 갖는다. 이 예에서 송신 시스템(source)은 수신 시스템(destination)으로 전송","words":[{"text":"기능을","x":156,"y":1371,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"갖는다.","x":272,"y":1371,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":401,"y":1371,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"예에서","x":451,"y":1370,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"송신","x":569,"y":1370,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시스템(source)은","x":657,"y":1370,"width":268,"height":39},{"text":"수신","x":941,"y":1370,"width":70,"height":38},{"te